<%- include('partials/header', { title: title }) %>
<!-- Display the service project details page, which shows the details of a single service project. 
It should show the following:
The title of the service project.
The description of the service project.
The date of the service project.
The location of the service project.
The name of the partner organization for the service project. 
This should be a link to the organization details page for that organization. 
The URL for this link should be /organization/[id], where [id] is the ID of the organization. -->
<main>
    <h1><%= project.title %></h1>
    <p><%= project.description %></p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> <%= new Date(project.date).toLocaleDateString() %></p>
    <p><strong>Location:</strong> <%= project.location %></p>
    <p><strong>Organized by:</strong> <a href="/organization/<%= project.organization_id %>"><%= project.organization_name %></a></p>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
